<沿革內容><![CDATA[1. Promulgated on December 26, 2025]]></沿革內容>
<前言><![CDATA[]]></前言>
<法規內容>
  <條文>
    <條號>Article 1</條號>
    <條文內容><![CDATA[The Standards are enacted pursuant to Article 7 and Paragraph 1 of Article 10 of the Charges and Fees Act.]]></條文內容>
  </條文>
  <條文>
    <條號>Article 2</條號>
    <條文內容><![CDATA[Medical care institutions or regenerative medicine biotechnology and pharmaceutical companies submitting applications pursuant to the " Regenerative Medicine Cell Operation Management Regulations" shall pay fees as follows:
1. New applications for a cell operation approval or substantial relocation of the operation site: NT$120,000.
2. Change to operation items or operational content:
(1) Addition of operation items or operational content: NT$120,000.
(2) Reduction of operation items or operational content: NT$10,000.
3. Change to operational areas:
(1) Addition of manipulation rooms or change of designated use: NT$120,000.
(2) Reduction of manipulation rooms: NT$10,000.
4. Extension of validity period: NT$120,000.
5. Changes of the name or address of the institution or the site: NT$10,000.]]></條文內容>
  </條文>
  <條文>
    <條號>Article 3</條號>
    <條文內容><![CDATA[Medical care institutions or regenerative medicine biotechnology and pharmaceutical companies submitting applications pursuant to the " Regenerative Medicine Cell Bank Establishment and Licensing Management Regulations" shall pay the fees prescribed as follows:
1. New application for cell bank establishment permit or substantial relocation of the operation site: NT$120,000.
2. Change to items preserved by the cell bank:
(1) Addition of preservation items: NT$120,000.
(2) Reduction of preservation items: NT$10,000.
3. Change to preservation areas:
(1) Addition of areas: NT$120,000.
(2) Reduction of areas: NT$10,000.
4. Extension of validity period: NT$120,000.
5. Change of the name or address of the establisher or the site of the cell bank: NT$10,000.
6. Change of the responsible person, medical director, or quality director of the establisher: NT$10,000.]]></條文內容>
  </條文>
  <條文>
    <條號>Article 4</條號>
    <條文內容><![CDATA[The Standards shall take effect on the date of the enforcement of the Regenerative Medicine Act.]]></條文內容>
  </條文>
</法規內容>
</法規>
